  "body": "## What changed\n- Added `AdaptiveTrochParams` (`max_engagement`, `ret`, `return_feed`, `loop_width`) and `adaptive_trochoidal_with` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch.rs`.\n- Added `troch: AdaptiveTrochParams` to `OpParams::Adaptive2D` and wired generation, door validation (`is_sane`, `named_refusal`, `microlift_refusal`), and staleness hashing (`0xA6` off default).\n- Extended `ParamsDto::Adaptive2D` with `return` (`AdaptiveTrochReturnDto`: `auto`, `microlift`, `retract`), `lift`, `return_feed`, `loop_width`, and `max_engagement` (for `optimal_load: Some(...)`, while preserving pre-M11.4 `optimal_load: None` Spiral migration).\n- Added `Max engagement`, `Loop width`, `Return`, `Microlift height`, and `Return feed` rows in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/kind_editors.rs` and `mill2d_page.rs`, visible only when `Method = Trochoidal`.\n- Recorded the design choices in `docs/decisions/1588-adaptive-troch-params.md`.\n\n## Cause\n- `adaptive_troch::cut_lane` hardcoded `max_engagement = 90.0`, `loop_width = None`, auto microlift/retract, and `return_feed = feed`, so users and MCP clients could not tune them on 2D Adaptive (Trochoidal).\n\n## Tests\n- Motion pin: `machining2d::adaptive_troch::tests::explicit_trochoidal_parameters_control_engagement_return_feed_and_loop_width` (red before fix, green after).\n- App/MCP pins: `mcp_edits_trochoidal_parameters_generates_refuses_limits_and_round_trips`, `trochoidal_parameters_undo_redo_and_round_trip_with_older_files_defaulting`, and `trochoidal_doors_refuse_out_of_range_and_over_clearance_values_by_name` in `crates/app/tests/adaptive_trochoid.rs` (MCP pin failed red on unchanged code, all green after).\n- UI pin: `egui_app::tests::adaptive_method::trochoidal_method_shows_its_passes_and_feeds_fields_and_spiral_and_offset_hide_them` (failed red on unchanged code, green after).\n- Mutation checks (all 4 failed red when reverted and passed green when restored):\n  - `crates/ui/src/egui_app/kind_editors.rs` (hiding Trochoidal UI rows) -> UI pin FAILED / restored PASSED.\n  - `crates/app/src/operation/types/sane.rs` (reverted to `upstream/main`) -> `trochoidal_doors_refuse` FAILED / restored PASSED.\n  - `crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch.rs` (hardcoded `cut_lane`) -> `explicit_trochoidal_parameters` FAILED / restored PASSED.\n  - `crates/app/src/project/params_impl.rs` (DTO ignoring `troch` fields) -> `trochoidal_parameters_undo_redo` FAILED / restored PASSED.\n- Current-head quick gate: motion passed (232s); app passed (861s); UI failed (32s) only at `headless_run_succeeds` because no graphics adapter is available. UI library: 802 passed, 1 failed, 5 ignored. All mapped UI integration suites passed.\n- Current-head strict all-targets clippy: app and motion passed. UI failed only on existing macOS dead-code warnings for `PNG_256` and `taskbar_icon` in `app_icon.rs`. UI diagnostic with only dead-code allowed passed.\n- Review merge pin: `merged_arc_and_trochoidal_parameters_round_trip_and_keep_the_arc_refusal` checks both parameter sets and both edit/generation refusals. Disabling the generation guard failed RED; restoration passed GREEN.\n- UI visibility pin extended for Microlift versus Retract/Auto. Removing the Microlift height row failed RED; restoration passed GREEN.\n\n## Goldens moved\n- None.\n\n## Not exercised\n- Interactive mouse drag of the new UI controls in a live window; structural egui tests exercise widget visibility and state binding.\n\n## Overlaps\n- Touches shared `OpParams` / `ParamsDto` / `generate.rs` / `kinds.rs` / `params.rs` files with open PRs `#1745`, `#1713`, `#518`, `#468` (different variants/arms; whichever merges second refreshes).\n\nChangelog: Expose engagement limit, return mode/lift, return feed and loop width parameters for 2D Adaptive (Trochoidal) in the UI, project files, and MCP.\n\nFixes #1588\n\n\n## UI review evidence\n\nThe same actual 2D Adaptive operation uses Method = Trochoidal in both tabs.\nAfter Passes selects Return = Microlift, height 0.4 mm. Before uses the original PR\nparent's pane body; after uses the merged pane. These captures rasterize the\nactual egui meshes and font atlas on the CPU because native GPU capture could\nnot find an adapter. Bitmap toolbar icons and the viewport texture are omitted.\n\n\n| Tab | Before | After |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Passes | ![Before Passes: Trochoidal](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1782/before/passes.png) | ![After Passes: Trochoidal with Microlift height](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1782/after/passes.png) |\n| Feeds | ![Before Feeds](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1782/before/feeds.png) | ![After Feeds with Return feed](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1782/after/feeds.png) |\n\n",
